<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian five-week T-note yields 5.880 pct.</title>
<headline>Australian five-week T-note yields 5.880 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS700 million   5.880	 5.87-5.88   5.876</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 90)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.849	 5.83-5.85   5.813</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 87)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS500 million   5.830	 5.83-5.84   5.847</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top three)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
